{
  "comment": "Emnedesign: design profiles as data. «tokens» are the design values; «components» are the inline-style templates per element role ({token} placeholders). Only CSS properties Canvas keeps are used (core/security/sanitize.py ALLOWED_CSS); every text colour pair meets WCAG 2.2 AA (tested). Change a profile by raising its version – courses store the profile id and version they chose.",
